    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(14th Level)</em></p><p><em>“No. Remove it.”</em></p><p>When you cast a removal or negation manifestation, you may massively enhance its scope once.</p><p>You may:</p><ul><li><p>Bypass one immunity or resistance to negation.</p></li><li><p>Extend the removal across multiple linked effects.</p></li><li><p>Force the suppression through layered defenses.</p></li></ul><p>Immediate consequence:</p><ul><li><p>risk the misfire ladder.</p></li><li><p>a misfire at the top of the ladder is guaranteed.</p></li></ul><p>This is not clever editing.</p><p>This is tearing a paragraph out of reality.</p><p>The universe will respond.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
